CORE
main.c
--polymath-convert _ --no-standard-checks --show-goto-functions
^ *DECL __CPROVER_property_switch_0 : 𝔹$
^ASSUME __CPROVER_property_switch_0 || validate::1::norwegian.nationality = address_of\("norwegian"\[0\]\)$
^ASSUME __CPROVER_property_switch_0 || validate::1::norwegian.book_genre = address_of\("fantasy"\[0\]\)$
^ *ASSERT __CPROVER_property_switch_0$
^ *DEAD __CPROVER_property_switch_0$
^ *DECL __CPROVER_scored_solution : struct tag-Solution$
^ *CALL validate\(__CPROVER_scored_solution\)$
^ *ASSERT main::1::solution ≠ __CPROVER_scored_solution$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^ *CALL validate\(main::1::solution\)$
^ *OUTPUT address_of\("solution"\[0\]\)$
^ *ASSERT 0 ≠ 0
